---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Experience | Muhammad Atif"
  description="18+ years of software engineering experience across .NET, SharePoint, Microsoft 365, Power Platform, cloud, and enterprise application development."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400">
        Career
      </p>

      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-100 md:text-5xl">
  18+ years of enterprise software engineering experience
</h1>

<p class="mt-6 text-xl leading-8 text-slate-300">
  My career spans enterprise application development, .NET, Microsoft 365,
  SharePoint, Power Platform, cloud platforms, and AI-powered solutions,
  with experience delivering modernization, migration, automation, and
  software engineering initiatives across GCC organizations.
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 space-y-12">
      <!-- Kalsoft Oman -->
      <article class="relative border-l-2 border-slate-700 pl-8">
        <div class="absolute -left-[9px] top-1 h-4 w-4 rounded-full border-4 border-slate-950 bg-slate-100"></div>

        <div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-2 md:flex-row md:items-start">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">
              Senior Software Engineer / SharePoint & Power Platform Developer
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-1 font-medium text-slate-300">
              Kalsoft LLC · Muscat, Oman
            </p>
          </div>

          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-400">
            2018 – Present
          </span>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-5 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Leading and delivering enterprise Microsoft solutions across
          SharePoint, Microsoft 365, Power Platform, custom .NET development,
          migration, automation, and AI initiatives.
        </p>

        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-slate-300">
          <li>
            • Designed and delivered enterprise SharePoint and Microsoft 365
            solutions across on-premises and cloud environments.
          </li>
          <li>
            • Delivered large-scale SharePoint migrations and modernization
            initiatives, including enterprise content migration and platform
            upgrades.
          </li>
          <li>
            • Developed business applications using Power Apps, Power Automate,
            SPFx, React, TypeScript, C#, and ASP.NET Core.
          </li>
          <li>
            • Designed workflow automation and digital business processes using
            Power Platform and Nintex.
          </li>
          <li>
            • Worked on AI-powered knowledge automation using LLMs, RAG,
            vector search, and intelligent enterprise solutions.
          </li>
          <li>
            • Provided technical leadership covering architecture, security,
            disaster recovery, migration planning, and solution delivery.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="skill-tag">SharePoint</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">Microsoft 365</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">Power Platform</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">SPFx</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">.NET</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">Azure</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">AI / RAG</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Kalsoft Dubai -->
      <article class="relative border-l-2 border-slate-700 pl-8">
        <div class="absolute -left-[9px] top-1 h-4 w-4 rounded-full border-4 border-slate-950 bg-slate-100"></div>

        <div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-2 md:flex-row md:items-start">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">
              Software Engineer / SharePoint Developer
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-1 font-medium text-slate-300">
              Kalsoft · Dubai, UAE
            </p>
          </div>

          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-400">
            2013 – 2017
          </span>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-5 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Developed enterprise SharePoint and .NET solutions for organizations
          across the GCC, combining custom software development with Microsoft
          collaboration and content-management platforms.
        </p>

        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-slate-300">
          <li>
            • Developed SharePoint-based enterprise applications and portals.
          </li>
          <li>
            • Built custom solutions using ASP.NET, C#, SQL Server, JavaScript,
            HTML, and CSS.
          </li>
          <li>
            • Implemented workflows, document management, and business process
            solutions.
          </li>
          <li>
            • Supported enterprise SharePoint architecture, customization, and
            administration.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="skill-tag">SharePoint</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">ASP.NET</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">C#</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">SQL Server</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">JavaScript</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Earlier Banking Experience -->
      <article class="relative border-l-2 border-slate-700 pl-8">
        <div class="absolute -left-[9px] top-1 h-4 w-4 rounded-full border-4 border-slate-950 bg-slate-100"></div>

        <div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-2 md:flex-row md:items-start">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">
              Software Engineer / Application Developer
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-1 font-medium text-slate-300">
              Enterprise & Banking Solutions
            </p>
          </div>

          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-400">
            2006 – 2013
          </span>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-5 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Built enterprise and banking applications with a strong focus on
          backend development, database-driven systems, business workflows,
          and integration.
        </p>

        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-slate-300">
          <li>
            • Developed business applications using .NET, ASP.NET, C#, and
            SQL Server.
          </li>
          <li>
            • Designed database-driven applications supporting enterprise
            business processes.
          </li>
          <li>
            • Worked on banking and financial application development and
            integration.
          </li>
          <li>
            • Progressed from application development toward enterprise
            architecture and Microsoft platform engineering.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="skill-tag">.NET</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">ASP.NET</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">C#</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">SQL Server</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">Enterprise Applications</span>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <!-- Career progression -->
    <section class="mt-16 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/60 p-8">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400">
        Career Evolution
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">
        From software engineering to enterprise architecture and AI
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-4">
        <div>
          <div class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-100">
            2006+
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300">
            .NET & enterprise application development
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-100">
            2010+
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300">
            SharePoint engineering & enterprise portals
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-100">
            2018+
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300">
            Microsoft 365, Power Platform & cloud modernization
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-100">
            Today
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300">
            AI, RAG, LLM applications & intelligent automation
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>